<section class="pricing section" id="pricing"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE SERVICE. TWO WAYS TO PAY.</span><h2>Your job search.<br>With follow-through.</h2></div><p>No job-offer guarantee.<br>Just a clear view of what you’re buying.</p></div><div class="price-layout"><article class="price-card"><div class="card-top"><span>DONE-FOR-YOU</span><span>30 counted service Business Days</span></div><h3>Job Search</h3><p>Get the application work off your plate.</p><div class="payment-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Payment option"><button aria-pressed="true" data-pay="full">Pay in full <small>Save $100</small></button><button aria-pressed="false" data-pay="split" {% unless settings.split_billing_verified %}disabled{% endunless %}>Split payments{% unless settings.split_billing_verified %} · Coming soon{% endunless %}</button></div><div class="bundle-offer" id="bundle-offer"><div class="bundle-heading"><span>SEARCH + INTERVIEW PREP</span><b>Save $50</b></div><label class="bundle-choice"><input type="checkbox" id="bundle-choice"><span><strong>Get interview-ready for $399.99 total</strong><small>Job Search + one live 45-minute Interview Prep session. Pay in full.</small></span></label><div class="bundle-comparison"><span>Purchased separately <s>$449.99</s></span><strong>Bundle $399.99</strong></div></div><div class="split-prep-note" id="split-prep-note" hidden>Starting with $99.99? Your Job Search total is $399.99. Interview Prep is purchased separately for $150 then booked separately. No bundle discount. Combined cost if you buy both: $549.99.</div><div class="amount"><strong id="amount">$299.99</strong><span id="amount-label">paid once</span></div><p class="payment-detail" id="payment-detail">$299.99 total. The same full service.</p><ul><li>Roles found and applications submitted</li><li>Résumé built around your experience</li><li>A dedicated job-search inbox</li><li>Weekly Friday progress reports</li></ul><button class="gold wide" id="review-plan">Review Job Search <span>↗</span></button><p class="fine">After purchase complete your Career Profile Setup.<br>Your counted days begin when we first apply.</p></article><div class="side-cards"><article class="prep-card"><div class="eyebrow">THE INTERVIEW IS NEXT</div><div class="prep-title"><h3>Walk in ready.</h3><span>↗</span></div><p>Interview Prep · $150<br>One live 45-minute session.</p><ol><li><span>01</span> Learn the interview formula</li><li><span>02</span> Shape your project stories</li><li><span>03</span> Practice with feedback</li></ol><button class="gold wide" id="quick-prep">Add prep to bundle · +$100.00</button><p class="fine" id="quick-prep-note">Pay in full: $399.99 total for Job Search + Interview Prep.</p><button class="quiet" id="prep">See what’s in the session ↗</button></article><article class="day-card"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT COUNTS AS A DAY?</span><p>A weekday when we submit applications. Weekends and holidays do not count. We apply on the business days beside a holiday but those days do not count either.</p><a href="/?view=policies#terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the service terms ↗</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="founder section" id="story"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE HUMAN STORY BEHIND JOBPLUG</span><h2>One connection.<br>A whole new direction.</h2></div><p>Seven chapters. One reason to keep going.<br>Helping someone else open their next door.</p></div><div class="story-cinema"><div id="story-scene"></div><div class="story-overlay"></div><div class="story-narrative" aria-live="polite"></div><img class="founder-guide" src="{{ 'plug-guide.png' | asset_url }}" alt="JobPlug guide accompanying the founder story"><div class="story-controls"><button id="story-prev" aria-label="Previous city">←</button><span id="story-count"></span><button id="story-next" aria-label="Next city">→</button></div></div><div class="story-route" aria-label="Choose a founder story chapter"></div><div class="story-foot"><span>A founder’s journey. City scenes illustrate each chapter.</span><a href="{{ 'photo-attributions.txt' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Photo credits ↗</a></div></section><section class="subscribe section"><div><span class="eyebrow">NOT READY TO BUY? KEEP YOUR MOMENTUM.</span><h2>Your next move starts<br>with a little preparation.</h2><p>Get a free Job Search Starter Checklist. Request your search-plan next steps by email. Career tips and service updates are optional.</p></div><div><button class="gold" data-signup>Get my free checklist ↗</button><p>No purchase required. Subscribe only if you choose.</p></div></section><section class="last section"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>Let’s get you moving.</h2><button class="gold" data-start>Explore my opportunity <span>↗</span></button><p>A few questions. No payment to explore.</p></section></main><footer><a class="brand" href="#">Job<span>Plug</span></a><p>JobPlug LLC · US clients only</p><div><a href="/?view=policies#terms">Terms</a><a href="/?view=policies#privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/?view=policies#refund">Refunds</a><a href="/?view=policies#help">FAQ</a><a href="mailto:support@jobplug.co">Contact</a></div></footer><div class="mobile-dock"><a href="#pricing">View pricing <span>From $299.99</span></a><button class="gold" data-start>Explore my opportunity ↗</button></div>
